---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Carson Farinella">
  <Nav />

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Based in Miami, FL</p>
      <h1>Carson<br /><em>Farinella</em></h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        Senior IT student at FIU, aiming for a Solutions Architect internship. I enjoy building things that are polished, cost-effective, and functional. Safe to assume I'm working on at least three projects.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="now">
      <h2>What I'm working on</h2>
      <ul class="project-list">
        <li>
          <span class="project-label">Homelab</span>
          <p>A self-hosted mini-cloud running out of a spare PC: a private password manager, a Minecraft server, automated nightly backups to two separate drives, and a Cloudflare Zero Trust tunnel so nothing needs an open port.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="project-label">MCP Server</span>
          <p>Designing a self-hosted MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for the homelab — giving Claude secure, scoped access to my email, file search, and Home Assistant setup, all through the existing Cloudflare Zero Trust tunnel.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="project-label">RBAC Server</span>
          <p>Led a five-person student dev team as scrum master through five Agile sprints to design and build a role-based access control server for FIU's Senior Capstone II. Ran sprint planning and code review end to end, while owning the auth engine implementation. Shipped and live-demoed a working RBAC system during the Summer '26 FIU Capstone Showcase.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-row">
      <a href="/resume" class="cta-primary">View Resume</a>
      <a href="/blog" class="cta-secondary">Read the blog</a>
      <a href="mailto:cfarinella1205@outlook.com" class="cta-secondary">Get in touch</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Carson Farinella</p>
    <span class="marks" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="mark" data-mark="a" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="11" height="11" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3.2" fill="currentColor" />
      </svg>
      <svg class="mark" data-mark="b" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="11" height="11" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.3" fill="currentColor" />
      </svg>
      <svg class="mark" data-mark="c" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="11" height="11" focusable="false">
        <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1.6" fill="currentColor" />
      </svg>
    </span>
    <a class="mark-link" href="/workbench" data-mark-link hidden>Workbench &rarr;</a>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline defer src="/scripts/footer-marks.js"></script>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 10vw, 6.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .tagline {
    max-width: 520px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .now {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }
  .project-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }
  .project-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .project-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }
  .project-list p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  padding-top: 1rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  margin-bottom: 4rem;
}
  .cta-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }
  .cta-primary:hover { opacity: 0.85; text-decoration: none; }
  .cta-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .cta-secondary {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding-bottom: 1px;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
}

  footer {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
  }

  .marks {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: var(--rule);
  }
  .mark {
    display: block;
    /* Padding widens the tap target without scaling the glyph — the 11px
       width/height attributes are the content box. */
    box-sizing: content-box;
    padding: 6px;
    touch-action: manipulation;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .mark.is-lit { color: var(--muted); }

  .mark-link {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
  }
  .mark-link[hidden] { display: none; }
  .mark-link.is-shown { opacity: 1; }
</style>